<title>ESTONIA: MARKET MAKERS FOR ESTFAIRS, KLEMENTI ANNOUNCED.</title>
<headline>MARKET MAKERS FOR ESTFAIRS, KLEMENTI ANNOUNCED.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tallinn Stock Exchange announced the market makers and minimum amounts for trading in Eesti Naitused (Estonian Fairs) and the textile company Klementi on Monday.</p>
<p>The minimum amount for Eesti Naitused, traded on the main list from Tuesday, is 500 shares, and the market makers are Forekspank, Hansapank and Hoiupank, the bourse said.</p>
<p>The minimum amount for Klementi, traded on the secondary list from Tuesday, is also 500 shares, and the market makers are Tallinna Pank, Forekspank, Hansapank and Innovatsioonipank.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn Newsroom, +372 630 8400, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
